  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Bank Assistance to Regional Integration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The evaluation was planned in two phases. Regarding the first phase, the approval for the TF resources came after the procurement of the firm for the first phase of the evaluation took place; therefore, it was not possible to use the resources for the contract. However, an addendum was approved later and the TF was used for this purpose. The results of the first phase will be presented to CODE in July 2012 after which guidance will be sought on the utilization of the remaining portion of the resources.
Approved: CAD 177,729 (Disbursed: Nil)</narrative>
  </description>
